        <dcterms:description>Published personal-health bridge bus that composes care transition outcomes, wellness transition routing, patient wellness acuity, daily-care safety, facilities accessibility, and fall criticality into a compact transition-response lane. PE owns source composition and writes the compact input lane; RE evaluates this machine as ordinary vector state.</dcterms:description>
