        <rdfs:label>Assistance Gap: STRUGGLING+ → ASSISTANCE_NEEDED signal</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/HomeFoodSecurityMonitor#seq-home-food-crisis-escalation -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/HomeFoodSecurityMonitor#seq-home-food-crisis-escalation">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#CriticalEventSequence"/>
        <re:hasInitialStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/HomeFoodSecurityMonitor#step-hf-adequate"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/HomeFoodSecurityMonitor#step-hf-adequate"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/HomeFoodSecurityMonitor#step-hf-crisis"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/HomeFoodSecurityMonitor#step-hf-insecure"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/HomeFoodSecurityMonitor#step-hf-strained"/>
        <re:sequenceId>home-food-crisis-escalation</re:sequenceId>
        <rdfs:comment>Tracks progressive food access deterioration from adequate household supply through food insecurity to acute crisis. The ADEQUATE+ initial state requires at least one confirmed adequate period before escalation can proceed — distinguishing genuine decline from temporary data gaps.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Food Security Deterioration: ADEQUATE+ → STRAINED → INSECURE → CRISIS → FOOD_CRISIS</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


