        <dcterms:description>Monitors prescription fill rates, dose adherence, cost-driven non-adherence, and generic/assistance program access for low- and medium-income adults managing chronic conditions at home. Medication cost barriers are a leading driver of avoidable hospitalization and disease progression in economically vulnerable populations. Output at [2011:2014] feeds the Home Social Isolation Monitor, capturing how pharmacy access barriers compound transportation and social barriers.</dcterms:description>
        <rdfs:label>Home Medication Cost Barrier Monitor</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


