        <re:hasRagStatus rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#AMBER"/>
        <re:matchesOutputPosition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</re:matchesOutputPosition>
        <re:outputMatchVector>0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0</re:outputMatchVector>
        <re:processStatus>warning</re:processStatus>
        <rdfs:comment>Level 3 — GOOD: Five wellness dimensions in norm; stress elevated but not clinically impairing. Monitor and offer stress-reduction activities.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>PatientWellness — wellness-level3-good rule 1 (AMBER)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#rule-wellness-level3-good-age-adjusted-1 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#rule-wellness-level3-good-age-adjusted-1">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#TriggerRule"/>
        <re:appliesToSequence rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level3-good-age-adjusted"/>
        <re:hasRagStatus rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#AMBER"/>
        <re:matchesOutputPosition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</re:matchesOutputPosition>
        <re:outputMatchVector>0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0</re:outputMatchVector>
        <re:processStatus>warning</re:processStatus>
        <rdfs:comment>Level 3 — GOOD (Age-Adjusted): Five wellness dimensions in norm; exercise below standard guideline but within age-adjusted functional capacity. Not penalized against an inapplicable standard.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>PatientWellness — wellness-level3-good-age-adjusted rule 1 (AMBER)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#rule-wellness-level4-optimal-1 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#rule-wellness-level4-optimal-1">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#TriggerRule"/>
        <re:appliesToSequence rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level4-optimal"/>
        <re:hasRagStatus rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#AMBER"/>
        <re:matchesOutputPosition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</re:matchesOutputPosition>
        <re:outputMatchVector>1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0</re:outputMatchVector>
        <re:processStatus>warning</re:processStatus>
        <rdfs:comment>Level 4 — OPTIMAL: All six wellness dimensions within age-adjusted norms. Resident is thriving. Maintain current care plan.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>PatientWellness — wellness-level4-optimal rule 1 (AMBER)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level1-critical -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level1-critical">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#CriticalEventSequence"/>
        <re:hasInitialStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-crit-declining"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-crit-acuity-fail"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-crit-declining"/>
        <re:sequenceId>wellness-level1-critical</re:sequenceId>
        <rdfs:comment>Mental acuity has fallen below the resident&apos;s age-cohort norm in the context of a previously established longitudinal decline trend (D6=H set from prior cycles). The combination of cognitive decline crossing the clinical threshold and an active worsening trajectory constitutes a critical wellness event requiring immediate clinical evaluation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Critical Wellness — Mental Acuity Failure with Established Decline Trend</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level2-alert -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level2-alert">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#CriticalEventSequence"/>
        <re:hasInitialStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-alert-mental"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-alert-decline"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-alert-mental"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-alert-nutrition"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-alert-social"/>
        <re:sequenceId>wellness-level2-alert</re:sequenceId>
        <rdfs:comment>Three of six wellness dimensions in norm (mental acuity, socialization, nutrition). Anxiety and stress are both elevated (D1=L, D2=L), exercise is below norm (D5=L). Longitudinal decline trend detected (D6=H). Requires care plan review and targeted interventions.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Alert Wellness — Multiple Deficits with Decline Trend</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level3-good -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level3-good">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#CriticalEventSequence"/>
        <re:hasInitialStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-good-mental"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-good-anxiety"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-good-exercise"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-good-mental"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-good-nutrition"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-good-social"/>
        <re:sequenceId>wellness-level3-good</re:sequenceId>
        <rdfs:comment>Five of six wellness dimensions confirmed in norm. Stress (D2) is below target — common in residents managing life transitions, bereavement, or care-adjustment stress. Mental acuity, anxiety, socialization, nutrition, and exercise are all adequate. No decline trend.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Good Wellness — Stress Sub-Optimal (Five Dimensions In Norm)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level3-good-age-adjusted -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level3-good-age-adjusted">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#CriticalEventSequence"/>
        <re:hasInitialStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-adj-mental"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-adj-anxiety"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-adj-mental"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-adj-nutrition"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-adj-social"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-adj-stress"/>
        <re:sequenceId>wellness-level3-good-age-adjusted</re:sequenceId>
        <rdfs:comment>For residents where the exercise norm has been age-adjusted (D7_AGE_ADJUSTED=H) — typically 75+ where standard exercise guidelines cannot be safely met — five non-exercise dimensions confirmed in norm is classified as GOOD rather than penalizing the resident against an inapplicable standard. Applies when D5_EXERCISE_OK=L is expected and acceptable given the resident&apos;s functional capacity.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Good Wellness — Age-Adjusted (Exercise Norm Calibrated, Five Dimensions In Norm)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level4-optimal -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#seq-wellness-level4-optimal">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/ontology/re-core#CriticalEventSequence"/>
        <re:hasInitialStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-opt-mental"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-opt-anxiety"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-opt-exercise"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-opt-mental"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-opt-nutrition"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-opt-social"/>
        <re:hasStep rdf:resource="https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-opt-stress"/>
        <re:sequenceId>wellness-level4-optimal</re:sequenceId>
        <rdfs:comment>All six wellness dimensions confirmed within age-adjusted norms. No decline trend. Applies to all age cohorts when the assessor calibrates each dimension to the resident&apos;s age group before scoring.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Optimal Wellness — All Six Dimensions in Norm</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://realityengine.example.org/machines/health-personal/PatientWellness#step-adj-anxiety -->

